!!! oculus/session/smoke.mat
!!! Smoke test for the full integrated session.
!!!
!!! Exercises: booting the desktop, creating a window, sending input,
!!! composing a frame, and verifying the full system is operational.

book oculus.session.smoke

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from oculus.window.viewport
read everything from oculus.window.workspace
read everything from oculus.window.lifecycle
read everything from oculus.window.record
read everything from oculus.window.operations
read everything from oculus.compositor.compositor
read everything from oculus.compositor.surface
read everything from oculus.compositor.frame
read everything from oculus.compositor.damage
read everything from oculus.compositor.output
read everything from oculus.input.event
read everything from oculus.input.routing
read everything from oculus.input.focus
read everything from oculus.input.pointer
read everything from oculus.appearance.appearance
read everything from oculus.appearance.theme
read everything from oculus.appearance.style
read everything from oculus.appearance.accessibility
read everything from oculus.appearance.color
read everything from oculus.session.shell
read everything from oculus.session.desktop-context
read everything from oculus.session.integration
read everything from oculus.session.boot

main returns number begin paragraph
    !!! Boot the viewport with scaling.
    value vp is build viewport with physical-width being 1920, physical-height being 1080, logical-width being 1200, logical-height being 675, scale-x being 1.6, scale-y being 1.6
    
    !!! Initialize the compositor.
    value comp is build compositor-state with frame-revision being 0, is-dirty being true
    
    when comp.is-dirty is at least 1 then
        say "compositor initialized"
    otherwise
        say "compositor init failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Set up input routing.
    value focus is build input-focus with focused-window-id being 0, has-focus being false
    value ptr-cursor is build point with x being 0, y being 0
    value ptr is build pointer-state with cursor-position being ptr-cursor, active-button being 0, is-hovering-window being false
    value routing is build routing-table with focus being focus, pointer-state being ptr, viewport-width being vp.logical-width, viewport-height being vp.logical-height
    
    when routing.viewport-width is at least 1200 then
        say "input routing initialized"
    otherwise
        say "input routing failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Create the appearance configuration.
    value bg is build color-value with red being 30, green being 30, blue being 30, alpha being 255
    value surface-color is build color-value with red being 40, green being 40, blue being 40, alpha being 255
    value text-color is build color-value with red being 240, green being 240, blue being 240, alpha being 255
    value accent is build color-value with red being 80, green being 160, blue being 255, alpha being 255
    value dark-theme is build theme with name being "Dark", background being bg, surface being surface-color, text-primary being text-color, text-secondary being text-color, accent being accent
    
    value style is build style-rules with corner-radius being 8, elevation being elevation.Medium, has-shadow being true, border-width being 1
    value a11y is build accessibility-config with contrast being contrast-level.Enhanced, reduce-motion being false, screen-reader-enabled being false, min-text-size being 14
    
    value appearance is build appearance-config with theme being "Dark", style being style, accessibility being a11y, is-ready being true
    
    when appearance.is-ready is at least 1 then
        say "appearance initialized"
    otherwise
        say "appearance failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Create the desktop context.
    value ctx is build desktop-context with viewport being vp, compositor being comp, routing being routing, appearance-theme being "Dark", active-window-id being 0, window-count being 0, is-ready being true
    
    when ctx.is-ready is at least 1 then
        say "desktop context initialized"
    otherwise
        say "desktop context failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Create a window through the window manager.
    value win is create-window with position-x being 100, position-y being 100, width being 800, height being 600, label being "Hello", window-id being 1
    
    when win.geometry.width is at least 800 then
        say "window created in desktop"
    otherwise
        say "window creation failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Simulate a keyboard event.
    value kb is build keyboard-event with key-code being 32, is-pressed being true, timestamp being 1000
    
    when kb.is-pressed is at least 1 then
        say "keyboard event dispatched"
    otherwise
        say "keyboard event failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Simulate a pointer event.
    value cursor is build point with x being 400, y being 300
    value pt is build pointer-event with position being cursor, button-mask being 1, is-moved being true, timestamp being 1001
    
    when pt.is-moved is at least 1 then
        say "pointer event dispatched"
    otherwise
        say "pointer event failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Compose a frame.
    value frame-surface is build surface with width being vp.logical-width, height being vp.logical-height, pixel-format being "RGBA8888"
    value damage is build damage-tracker with has-damage being true
    value frame is build frame with revision being 1, surface being frame-surface, damage being damage, output-id being 0, is-dirty being true
    
    when frame.revision is at least 1 then
        say "frame composed"
    otherwise
        say "frame composition failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Initialize the session shell.
    value shell is build session-shell with state being shell-state.Running, frame-revision being 1, event-count being 2
    
    when shell.event-count is at least 2 then
        say "session shell is running"
    otherwise
        say "session shell failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Final verification: the full system is operational.
    say "Oculus: all subsystems operational"
    
    give 0
end paragraph
